SUMMARY:West 94th Street Pub: Thanksgiving 300 FREE Meals TO GO
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nHello all\, Kerry over at the West 9
 4th Street Pub is really awesome and has this event for those that will be
  in town and need some food if you have no plans\, just need some food\, o
 r just want live the spirit of Thanksgiving. Here's a little info:\n\n***T
 he Pub will be giving away 300 TO GO meals on Thanksgiving morning\, 10am-
 11:30am. Its not only for the homeless\, but for those who are single\, co
 llege students\, elderly or for couples who just don’t want to cook. Dri
 ve up\, Pick up\, & Enjoy! The Pub will be open to the public starting at 
 noon for those who want to get together and socialize with others.***
