SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Potluck
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nUpdate: We have adjusted the time to
  start at 5pm for those who would like to come early and enjoy corn hole\,
  a warm fire an good company while we get everything set up.\n\nSign up fo
 r potluck dish contributions here: [https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C094
 9AFA62CABFA7-67699827-thanksgiving#/](https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C0
 949AFA62CABFA7-67699827-thanksgiving#/)\n\nPlease join us for a feast and 
 friendship. We are so greatful to be a part of this group and would love f
 or you to join us this Thanksgiving.\n\nWe will send out a sign up sheet c
 loser to the date with food and items to bring.\n\nWe will be doing a fire
 pit with S'mores following dinner.
