SUMMARY:Ebenezer Movie @ CMX CineBistro
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nReady to get in the spirit? Or to se
 e the spirits?\n\nJoin us for a viewing of Ebenezer the new adaptation wit
 h Johnny Depp.\n\nWe will be watching at CMX CineBistro at Waverly Place\,
  with a tentative start time of 2pm.\n\nOnce tickets are available for pur
 chase we will update with the exact start time and post a link to purchase
  tickets.
