DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nThis month we’re reading\, “Four
 th Wing” by Rebecca Yarros.\n\nCome join us at Namu for a fun discussion
  about the book! I’ll arrive ahead of time and will post in the comments
  where to find me.\n\nCan’t wait to see everyone!
